\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\lang1040\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. I AM not worthy, holy Lord,
\par That Thou shouldst come to me;
\par Speak but the word : one gracious word 
\par Can set the sinner free.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. I am not worthy: cold and bare
\par The lodging of my soul;
\par How canst Thou deign to enter there?
\par Lord, speak and make me whole.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. I am not worthy: yet, my God,
\par How can I say Thee nay,
\par Thee, who didst give Thy flesh and blood
\par My ransomed price to pay?
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. O come, in this sweet morning hour,
\par Feed me with food divine;
\par And fill with all Thy love and power
\par This worthless heart of mine. 
\par \pard\qj                                      Amen.
\par 
\par \pard\lang1033\f1 
\par \cf1\lang1040\ul\b\f2\fs16 
\par }

